 * T5 neighbourhood page — Greathouse, north-west Midland, Midland County.
 *
 * THE DISTINGUISHING FACTS:
 *
 * 1. A TWELVE-YEAR GAP. Greathouse Addition Section 1 was recorded
 *    1992-01-14 (Max W. Richardson, Cab F Pg 45) — and then nothing until the
