 *  - Not in mapped 100-year floodplain; no mapped playa inside the extent.
 *  - Midland County IS on the imported fire ant regulated-areas list.
 *
 * THE NAME — HANDLE PRECISELY. The school and subdivision take the name of
 * Barney R. Greathouse (d. 1973), a Midland druggist and civic figure who,
 * with George H. W. Bush and two others, chartered the Commercial Bank and
 * Trust. His widow Helen Greathouse (1908–2001) created the Helen Greathouse
 * Charitable Trust in 1997. CRITICAL: the Trust's own biography makes NO
 * mention of land, ranching or real-estate development. DO NOT state or imply
 * that the family owned or developed this land. The name connection is
