 *
 * NOT ESTABLISHED — MUST NOT BE STATED:
 *  - Any HOA. None was found on the first page of the Texas HOA registry for
 *    Midland County, but that listing is paginated, so absence is NOT proven.
 *    The page says we could not find one, not that there is none.
 *  - Acreage, lot counts, alleys, curbs, developer name.
 *  - Attendance zones. The campus is inside the plat; that is geography, not
